  "description": "CR 120.3, 603.7a, 603.7b, 611.2a, 601.3, 305.1: Waltz of Rage's target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to each other creature, and until end of turn each creature you control that dies exiles the top card of your library, playable until the end of your next turn",
  "note": "Waltz can't target bob's Craw Wurm. Alice's Hill Giant (power 3) deals 3 to each other creature: her Grizzly Bears and Raging Goblin and bob's Savannah Lions die, bob's Craw Wurm survives with 3 damage and the Giant takes none. Her two creatures dying exile her top two cards (bob's Lions exile nothing): she plays the Mountain as her land. On bob's turn the delayed trigger has ended: his Lightning Bolt kills the Giant and her library stays as it was. In her next turn's upkeep she casts the exiled Lightning Bolt at bob with that Mountain.",
